","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons:m0006","quote":"敬倫"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-013","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons:m0040","quote":"昆"}],"identity_note":"華廙子，先辭祖爵，後嗣父爵。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084","quote":"廙棲遲家巷垂十載，教誨子孫，講誦經典。集經書要事，名曰《善文》，行於世。與陳勰共造豬闌於宅側，帝嘗出視之，問其故，左右以實對，帝心憐之。帝后又登陵雲台，望見廙苜蓿園，阡陌甚整，依然感舊。太康初大赦，乃得襲封。久之，拜城門校尉，遷左衛將軍。數年，以為中書監。惠帝即位，加侍中、光祿大夫、尚書令，進爵為公。廙應楊駿召，不時還，有司奏免官。尋遷太子少傅，加散騎常侍，動遵禮典，得傅導之義。後年衰病篤，詔遣太醫療病，進位光祿大夫、開府儀同三司。時河南尹韓壽因托賈后求以女配廙孫陶，廙距而不許，後深以為恨，故遂不登臺司。年七十五卒，諡曰元。三子：混、薈、恆。","source_term":"三子：混、薈、恆"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-w044-huayi-1","interpretation_note":"原文明記兩代；人號不表長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"418_c91_b6b_AA","label":"華陶〔鞏令〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"陶","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0234","c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0026"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084","mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0234","quote":"陶"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086","mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0026","quote":"陶"}],"identity_note":"華混子，廙孫。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"conne