，得傅導之義。後年衰病篤，詔遣太醫療病，進位光祿大夫、開府儀同三司。時河南尹韓壽因托賈后求以女配廙孫陶，廙距而不許，後深以為恨，故遂不登臺司。年七十五卒，諡曰元。三子：混、薈、恆。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0268","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0236"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-w044-huayi-4","subject_person_id":"418_c91_b6b_AA","object_person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子陶嗣"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086","quote":"混字敬倫，嗣父爵，清貞簡正，歷位侍中、尚書，卒官。子陶嗣，補鞏令，沒于石勒。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0026","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-w044-huayi-sg-0","subject_person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","object_person_id":"418_c91_b6b","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"廙三子"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-013","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons","quote":"廙三子。昆字敬倫，清粹有檢，爲尚書。薈字敬叔。世語稱薈貴正。恒字敬則，以通理稱。昆，尚書；薈，河南尹；恒，左光祿大夫開府。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons:m0004","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu