"end":18,"surface":"侍中","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0000","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-w044-huayi-23","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","title":"尚書","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086","quote":"混字敬倫，嗣父爵，清貞簡正，歷位侍中、尚書，卒官。子陶嗣，補鞏令，沒于石勒。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0000"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w043-huayi-23:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"尚書","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0000","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082","text":"初，表有賜客在鬲，使廙因縣令袁毅錄名，三客各代以奴。及毅以貨賕致罪，獄辭迷謬，不復顯以奴代客，直言送三奴與暠，而毅亦盧氏婿也。又中書監荀勖先為中子求廙女，廙不許，為恨，因密啟帝，以袁毅貨賕者多，不可盡罪，宜責最所親者一人，因指廙當之。又綠廙有違忤之咎，遂於喪服中免暠官，削爵土。大鴻臚何遵奏廙免為庶人，不應襲封，請以表世孫混嗣表。有司奏曰：「廙所坐除名削爵，一時之制。廙為世子，著在名簿，不聽襲嗣，此為刑罰再加。諸侯犯法，八議平處者，褒功重爵也。嫡統非犯終身棄罪，廢之為重，依律應聽襲封。」詔曰：「諸侯薨，子逾年即位，此古制也。應即位而廢之，爵命皆去矣，何為罪罰再加？且吾之責廙，以肅貪穢，本不論常法也。諸賢不能將明此意，乃更詭易禮律，不顧憲度，君命廢之，而群下復之，此為上下正相反也。」於是有司奏免議者官，詔皆以贖論。混以世孫當受封，逃避，斷髮陽狂，病喑不能語，故得不拜，世咸稱之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":