"kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":82,"last_line":82,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　初，表有賜客在鬲，使廙因縣令袁毅錄名，三客各代以奴。及毅以貨賕致罪，獄辭迷謬，不復顯以奴代客，直言送三奴與暠，而毅亦盧氏婿也。又中書監荀勖先為中子求廙女，廙不許，為恨，因密啟帝，以袁毅貨賕者多，不可盡罪，宜責最所親者一人，因指廙當之。又綠廙有違忤之咎，遂於喪服中免暠官，削爵土。大鴻臚何遵奏廙免為庶人，不應襲封，請以表世孫混嗣表。有司奏曰：「廙所坐除名削爵，一時之制。廙為世子，著在名簿，不聽襲嗣，此為刑罰再加。諸侯犯法，八議平處者，褒功重爵也。嫡統非犯終身棄罪，廢之為重，依律應聽襲封。」詔曰：「諸侯薨，子逾年即位，此古制也。應即位而廢之，爵命皆去矣，何為罪罰再加？且吾之責廙，以肅貪穢，本不論常法也。諸賢不能將明此意，乃更詭易禮律，不顧憲度，君命廢之，而群下復之，此為上下正相反也。」於是有司奏免議者官，詔皆以贖論。混以世孫當受封，逃避，斷髮陽狂，病喑不能語，故得不拜，世咸稱之。","raw_start":6485,"raw_end":6879,"raw_line":82},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084","text":"廙棲遲家巷垂十載，教誨子孫，講誦經典。集經書要事，名曰《善文》，行於世。與陳勰共造豬闌於宅側，帝嘗出視之，問其故，左右以實對，帝心憐之。帝后又登陵雲台，望見廙苜蓿園，阡陌甚整，依然感舊。太康初大赦，乃得襲封。久之，拜城門校尉，遷左衛將軍。數年，以為中書監。惠帝即位，加侍中、光祿大夫、尚書令，進爵為公。廙應楊駿召，不時還，有司奏免官。尋遷太子少傅，加散騎常侍，動遵禮典，得傅導之義。後年衰病篤，詔遣太醫療病，進位光祿大夫、開府儀同三司。時河南尹韓壽因托賈后求以女配廙孫陶，廙距而不許，後深以為恨，故遂不登臺司。年七十五卒，諡曰元。三子：混、薈、恆。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"陳勰","kind":"person","person_id":"0jn_zly_6n7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0078","start":78,"end":79,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"7e0_f69_1ac","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0151","start":151,"end":152,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"楊駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0222","start":222,"end":224,"surface":"韓壽","kind":"person","person_id":"wwi_1cy_1ui","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"賈后","kind":"person","person_id":"c27_590_7e3_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0232","start":232,"end":233,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0234","start":234,"end":235,"surface":"陶","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0236","start":236,"end":237,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0268","start":268,"end":269,"surface":"混","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0270","start":270,"end":271,"surface":"薈","kind":"person","person_id":"4e0_afd_055","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line084:m0272","start":272,"end":273,"surface":"恆","kind":"person","person_id":"eom_42c_5zd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":84,"last_line":84,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　廙棲遲家巷垂十載，教誨子孫，講誦經典。集經書要事，名曰《善文》，行於世。與陳勰共造豬闌於宅側，帝嘗出視之，問其故，左右以實對，帝心憐之。帝后又登陵雲台，望見廙苜蓿園，阡陌甚整，依然感舊。太康初大赦，乃得襲封。久之，拜城門校尉，遷左衛將軍。數年，以為中書監。惠帝即位，加侍中、光祿大夫、尚書令，進爵為公。廙應楊駿召，不時還，有司奏免官。尋遷太子少傅，加散騎常侍，動遵禮典，得傅導之義。後年衰病篤，詔遣太醫療病，進位光祿大夫、開府儀同三司。時河南尹韓壽因托賈后求以女配廙孫陶，廙距而不許，後深以為恨，故遂不登臺司。年七十五卒，諡曰元。三子：混、薈、恆。","raw_start":6881,"raw_end":7157,"raw_line":84},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086","text":"混字敬倫，嗣父爵，清貞簡正，歷位侍中、尚書，卒官。子陶嗣，補鞏令，沒于石勒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"混","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"敬倫","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"陶","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line086:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"石勒","kind":"person","person_id":"0c9_95a_18b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":86,"last_line":86,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　混字敬倫，嗣父爵，清貞簡正，歷位侍中、尚書，卒官。子陶嗣，補鞏令，沒于石勒。","raw_start":7159,"raw_end":7199,"raw_line":86},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons","text":"廙三子。昆字敬倫，清粹有檢，爲尚書。薈字敬叔。世語稱薈貴正。恒字敬則，以通理稱。昆，尚書；薈，河南尹；恒，左光祿大夫開府。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"廙","kind":"person","person_id":"418_c91_b6b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-013-jin044-huayi:sons:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"昆"